{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eb5f5d7e80db56088f23c6ad065ba99b3c68e13cf1e5c14c917c4c87261aec33", "ja": "（コスプレグラビア企画ということで、事前の莉緒の\n反応は上々だった。……のだが、少し様子が変だな？）", "zh": "（因为是角色扮演写真企划，莉绪事前的反应相当不错。……不过，她的样子好像有点不对劲？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "30b392fa06a02a99bdc00f898ac59b853b1fb952f9412c668ba5bb76bcf573da", "ja": "{$P$}くん……。\nこの衣装、似合ってる？　ちょっと子供っぽくない？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n这身衣服，适合我吗？会不会有点孩子气？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dc0d5786f4e4baebd65e4d19c901a29d08c61fe3a952f3506c5fe8f4031de8af", "ja": "えっ？　そうか？\nいつもと違う雰囲気で、可愛いと思うけど……。", "zh": "诶？是吗？我觉得这种和平时不一样的感觉很可爱啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "729ba10937fd55820c51d1050323ebface2e9df1cf6c1861b251f58eb0fa1f4d", "ja": "確かに、大きな耳とか尻尾とか、肉球のグローブとか\nとっても可愛いと思うわ！　でもね……。", "zh": "确实，大大的耳朵啊、尾巴啊、肉球手套啊，\n我觉得都超级可爱！可是呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "627cc391cce6bce1238dad92889b1d83e98e9e155f46cb523cdebd1778ba4c69", "ja": "露出が少ないと思わない！？\nこれじゃあ、私の魅力が全然出ない気がするの！", "zh": "你不觉得露得太少了吗！？这样一来，我的魅力感觉完全展现不出来啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1005_p", "source_sha256": "dc4b1cdeffd2c276cdb15db1430568faef5a46cadb90ebb25d13825a8012ac75", "ja": "そんなことないぞ。普段との意外性は魅力の一つだ。\nそれに『犬』って題材も、莉緒に合ってると思うよ。", "zh": "没这回事。和往常的反差也是魅力之一。\n而且我觉得以“狗”为题材，也很适合莉绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "1f0280477f3681f3c732e1cb7113eae18734a0887f03d42fd9b65e95d16d55a5", "ja": "ふーん、そう？\n自分じゃ、あんまりピンとこないけど……。", "zh": "嗯——是吗？\n我自己倒不太有这种感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6fd11a432bd3a6982b31604147f22b1118224867f137628167d19cc0676773a7", "ja": "ほら。犬は、元気で人懐っこいイメージがあるだろ？\n人間のパートナーって感じで賢いし。", "zh": "你看，狗给人的印象就是精力充沛又亲近人，对吧？\n而且很聪明，有种人类伙伴的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1008_p", "source_sha256": "92df4435b5600483b30594dc674abff9e17b40a4b0398cc505635b44613bb010", "ja": "気持ちをダイレクトに伝えたりするところも、\n莉緒にピッタリなんじゃないかと。", "zh": "我觉得它们会直接表达自己的心情这一点，也和莉绪特别合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "52a2ec71823b9a3e95ed4854b2ff9c49782519bad5c9fc03b0ed3376c167f40b", "ja": "なるほどね……。{$P$}くん、\n私のこと、そんな風に……。", "zh": "原来如此……{$P$}，你居然那样看我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "a535ffc4b108507d0c4d9d6f70fc85265e7f03120354d6f4a39013995fff2791", "ja": "ん？　でもこの衣装がピッタリって……\nもしかして私のこと、イヌみたいだって思ってる！？", "zh": "嗯？不过，你说这套服装特别适合我……难道你觉得我像狗一样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e39efc8fc70b949b9c327f365d0cd4a8b616e8c5bbe559ce5dade73dcfbb7811", "ja": "思ってない思ってない！　今のは例え話で……。\nえっと、だから言いたいのは……。", "zh": "没想没想！刚才只是打个比方……\n呃，所以我想说的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9bc93b2354bd9a7bc63c87c474058092d20be40c890729d617ac04226b96c358", "ja": "どんな衣装を着ても、莉緒は自分の魅力をみせることが\nできるから、いい写真になるって信じてるんだ。", "zh": "我相信不管穿什么服装，莉绪都能展现出自己的魅力，拍出来一定会是很棒的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "a9ae5c2b2370dae4621f80d1efea0648e161fa08c07ae37a64a03c2b7d269914", "ja": "……言ってくれるじゃない。\nそんなこと言われたら、私も燃えてきちゃうわ♪", "zh": "……真敢说呢。\n被你这么一说，我也要燃起斗志来了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "2ca2e683ce7e21c1e36aa1927bf184269226bb033f4aba02c03683c317ea3764", "ja": "うふっ。こうなったら最高のグラビアを撮って、\n{$P$}くんを見返してやるんだから！", "zh": "呵呵。既然都这样了，我一定要拍出最棒的写真，\n让{$P$}对我刮目相看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0483_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "4ebc9b1af5a7a58003502f9e420f5ddc128ffc93773e769c78727898e30456ef", "ja": "……って、なんか私、うまく言いくるめられてない？\n気のせいかしら？", "zh": "……不对，怎么感觉我像是被巧妙地绕进去了？\n是我的错觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
